  Ultralytics repo:
  https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
  MediaPipe face detection docs:
  https://mediapipe.readthedocs.io/en/latest/solutions/face_detection.html
  Face detection implementation walkthrough:
  https://denshub.com/en/face-detection-tracking-models/

- Pick 2 face-localisation libraries to test
  Library option 1: MediaPipe
  https://mediapipe.readthedocs.io/en/latest/solutions/face_detection.html
  Library option 2: RetinaFace Python package
  https://github.com/serengil/retinaface
  Extra comparison article:
  https://medium.com/pythons-gurus/what-is-the-best-face-detector-ab650d8c1225

- Pick 2 face-detection models to test
  Model option 1: BlazeFace via MediaPipe
  https://mediapipe.readthedocs.io/en/latest/solutions/face_detection.html
  Model option 2: RetinaFace
  https://github.com/serengil/retinaface
  YOLO-style practical example:
  https://denshub.com/en/face-detection-tracking-models/

- Build a minimal Python webcam script that draws face boxes or landmarks
  OpenCV webcam skeleton:
  https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/python/face-detection-using-python-and-opencv-with-webcam/
  MediaPipe webcam example:
  https://mediapipe.readthedocs.io/en/latest/solutions/face_detection.html
  YOLO webcam example:
  https://denshub.com/en/face-detection-tracking-models/

- Add rough timing or FPS output to the webcam test
  Practical real-time implementation examples:
  https://denshub.com/en/face-detection-tracking-models/

- Test each option with a frontal face in good lighting
  Use your webcam test script and log whether detection is immediate and stable

- Test each option with a turned head
  Use your webcam test script and log whether the box stays locked on the face

- Test each option in dimmer lighting
  Use your webcam test script and log missed detections and jitter

- Test each option with natural movement in frame
  Use your webcam test script and log stability while leaning or shifting

- Record quick notes on stability, speed, and detection quality
  Comparison reading:
  https://medium.com/pythons-gurus/what-is-the-best-face-detector-ab650d8c1225
  Practical comparison and code:
  https://denshub.com/en/face-detection-tracking-models/

- Choose the face-localisation approach to recommend
  Base the decision on your notes from the 4 webcam conditions

- Set up FasterWhisper in Python
  PyPI:
  https://pypi.org/project/faster-whisper/
  Repo:
  https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper
  Guide:
  https://generalistprogrammer.com/tutorials/faster-whisper-python-package-guide

- Make a short speech test phrase list
  Include:
  1. normal sentence
  2. technical sentence
  3. short command
  4. fast sentence
  5. slightly mumbled sentence

- Run FasterWhisper on the test phrases
  Official package page with usage example:
  https://pypi.org/project/faster-whisper/

- Record transcription quality and delay
  FasterWhisper benchmarks and usage:
  https://pypi.org/project/faster-whisper/

