  https://pypi.org/project/SpeechRecognition/
  SpeechRecognition microphone tutorial:
  https://www.mygreatlearning.com/blog/speech-recognition-python/
  FasterWhisper PyPI:
  https://pypi.org/project/faster-whisper/

